        "content": "### Severity Score Calculation\n\nThe score is a composite metric combining:\n- **Elapsed Time per Exec (s)** (weight 25%) | **CPU Time per Exec (s)** (weight 25%) | **Buffer Gets per Exec** (weight 15%) | **Disk Reads per Exec** (weight 10%) | **User I/O Wait per Exec (s)** (weight 10%)\n- **Unoptimized Reads per Exec** (weight 5%) | **Parse Calls** (weight 5%) | **Cluster Wait Time per Exec (s)** (weight 5%)\n\n> Higher score indicates greater severity (performance issue).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
